#include <algorithm>

bool is_present(const std::vector<int>& sorted_vec, int val) {
    return std::binary_search(sorted_vec.begin(), sorted_vec.end(), val);
}
---
Replaced linear search O(N) with binary search O(log N). Since the input is known to be sorted, binary search drastically reduces the number of comparisons needed to find the element.

